Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In 1999, the Akihabara Maid Cafe\Nindustry was led by two major players,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Creatureland and Maid Alien groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two forces were in a delicate balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite minor scuffles\Namong low-ranking cafes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the town maintained a facade of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.51,0:00:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko Maanen returns to being a maid\Nafter serving 15 years for a gang war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On her very first day, Ronko annihilates\Na maid cafe from a rival group.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She raids a casino,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.02,0:00:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an underground fight club, and even a cafe\Naffiliated with her same parent group.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As tensions rise, the one behind\Nmade aliens rise to prominence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A maid known as Crimson\NSupernova returns to Akihabara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an honor to have you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta feel the winds of\Nfreedom, you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for joining us.
