Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.02,0:02:47.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(230,551)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Extra-Akiba
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.02,0:02:47.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(230,626)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Terrestrials
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.36,0:02:50.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(407.6,557.8)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Blood in a Sisterly Troth and the Menace of the Red Bat
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to have you back, Manami.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.74,0:02:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the current head, Ugaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.50,0:02:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From this day forward, you work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.72,0:03:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening with Akiba Big Bang?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming along just fine, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.12,0:03:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since I became head,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've doubled our earnings and\Nwe're gaining fast on Creature Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it I see no one\Nfrom Wuv Wuv Moonbeam here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.14,0:03:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're no longer among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They misbehaved a tad too much and got\Ncrushed by some Creature Underlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.22,0:03:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a shame, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.42,0:03:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Manami, put that\Nthing down and let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.58,0:03:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flinging around guns, blades,\Nand bats is a thing of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.82,0:03:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what were you all\Ndoing the seven years I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.22,0:03:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was sitting behind bars\Neating prison sloth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.23,0:03:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the second generation head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.14,0:03:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just one of the senior members.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.90,0:03:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.81,0:03:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see having\Nthese softies around makes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.72,0:03:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,made alien look like a\Nbunch of damn wusses?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.22,0:03:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those days are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.52,0:03:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.43,0:03:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't care that\Nthey talk shit about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you call yourself a fucking maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:04:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's important for a\Nmaid to have credibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please calm down, Manami. Tell me, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you angry not settling\Na scoring at how we maids do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.44,0:04:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, of course, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.80,0:04:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you tell me\Nwhat's been happening and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.28,0:04:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which creature bastards\Ntook out Wub Wub Moonbeam?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.24,0:04:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky-doink, oink.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.66,0:04:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky-doink cafe, Miss Manami.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.80,0:04:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the oinky-doink
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.62,0:04:23.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(902,86)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Creatureland
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.99,0:04:27.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(154,130)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Greetings,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.99,0:04:27.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(154,205)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}I hope that the early summer is finding you all well.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.99,0:04:27.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(154,281)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}We are writing to announce that
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.99,0:04:27.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(154,356)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}MANAMI SUPERNOVA YAMAGISHI
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.99,0:04:27.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(154,432)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}has taken over as acting head of the Maidalien Group.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.99,0:04:27.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(154,508)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}We hope for your continued guidance and support
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.99,0:04:27.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(154,583)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}as we begin this new chapter.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.99,0:04:27.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(154,659)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Sincerely yours,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.99,0:04:27.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(154,734)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Maidalien Group Head
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.99,0:04:27.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(154,810)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Kazue Ugaki
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.18,0:04:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Manami
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the Crimson Supernova is back
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.38,0:04:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.44,0:04:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wiping out a sister cafe and a\Nlucrative one like Maid Sheep is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.82,0:04:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inexcusable behavior. But they were\Nthe ones who started. Second of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.34,0:04:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maid Alien has lodged a complaint with\Nus about how you crushed Wub Wub Moonbeam
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.38,0:04:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't change the\Nfact that you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that wasn't really our fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.44,0:04:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think pigs are really\Ncreatures to begin with?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please let us still be creatures!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.12,0:04:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can only be called creatures\Nwhen you can contribute to the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.54,0:05:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This matter of you\Ncrushing Wav Wav Moonbeam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go settle it with Made Alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.42,0:05:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.24,0:05:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, um, a tiny cafe like us can't do\Nanything about a major group like...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.70,0:05:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then if you can't, pigs will\Nbecome extinct here in Akiba.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.05,0:05:25.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(139.2,670.4)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.81,0:05:30.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(681.6,123.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}DORAMA
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.81,0:05:30.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(787,529)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Ramen
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.76,0:05:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beer, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.10,0:05:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus soy sauce ramen and\Na pork cutlet rice bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.76,0:05:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We look like we're in the same business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, I... No, no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just here for the chow today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing better than some ramen and beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.54,0:05:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it two glasses, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.36,0:05:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never thought a joint like\Nthis would still be around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.72,0:05:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young ones these days just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.72,0:06:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the stuff, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that this ramen shop is\Nhere is enough to keep Hanakiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.92,0:06:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well said, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.10,0:06:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New ain't always the answer to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.22,0:06:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some things best not change or be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.82,0:06:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.06,0:06:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ubi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.56,0:06:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So yeah, they're totally\Ndone for. You sure? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.52,0:06:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.43,0:06:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's on edge right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.82,0:06:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of strange,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.10,0:06:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but our group has changed its policies\Nnow that Crimson Supernova is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.46,0:06:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.37,0:06:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're saying we need\Nto wipe out anything
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that stands in the way\Nof the Akiva Big Bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that we might have to\Ngo to war with Creatureland.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.30,0:07:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.78,0:07:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I was hoping to be better\Nfriends with you, Nerula.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.56,0:07:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need everyone at the Oinky Doink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.54,0:07:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, a friend of yours? Yes, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Nerula from Invader Cafe Destron.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.02,0:07:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very nice to meet you, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I'm the manager at Oinkidoink. Nice\Nto meet you. It's a pleasure. Okay, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.10,0:07:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, okay. See ya. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.76,0:07:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.22,0:07:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's now our job to do\Nsomething about Maid Alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.34,0:07:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To put it bluntly, it means\Nwe're supposed to go die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.56,0:07:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you mean Creature Land's\Njust gonna abandon us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.42,0:07:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.74,0:07:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take the five million\Nfrom the sheep and the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.98,0:07:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think there's\Nanywhere we can run to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.70,0:07:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then how about we take it back\Nto Made Alien and say sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like five million's even enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.88,0:07:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Made Alien is a major player on\Npar with the Creatureland group.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.86,0:07:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll have to take out their leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.86,0:07:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds practical.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.50,0:07:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The head of the group?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:07:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't you be heavily guarded by aliens?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.58,0:08:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, like, who's even the\Nhead of Made Alien anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Crimson Supernova.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crimson what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.28,0:08:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently they're back with Made Alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.20,0:08:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we apologize really\Nhard, they'll forgive us. You
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should have realized by now\Nthat that kind of thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't fly in this business\Nyeah I know that but it's just
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah yeah I know you still\Ndon't like the whole violence
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.72,0:08:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aspect but hey someone might\Ndie trying to protect you if
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.68,0:08:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can't fight hear me yes\Nthat's right I'd like to get
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.28,0:08:33.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(484.8,750.4)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some information on the head\Nof made alien uh no wait hold
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on please uh hello she seriously\Njust hung up on me damn it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.38,0:08:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh hey what's up nagomi do you think\Nwe're going to have to fight made alien
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's just i really don't want to have to\Nfight my friend have to fight a friend oh
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.74,0:08:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you mean sure i get it of course you don't\Nwant to fight her i don't know what to do
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.74,0:09:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if you become sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.78,0:09:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.69,0:09:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we become sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just swear an oath with another\Nmaid and exchange name tags.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.24,0:09:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Nerula is a member\Nof the Maid Alien group.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.06,0:09:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.18,0:09:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't hope for our leader's blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not even a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you understand that the bond of sisterhood\Nis super important to a maid, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.84,0:09:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a bond of sisterhood?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here in this cafe, I'm known\Nas your parent, Nogomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to act as a witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.46,0:09:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think Nerula will\Nagree to being my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure she will!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.70,0:09:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's your friend, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.06,0:09:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making an oath of sisterhood, I worried may\Nbe risky with a maid from another group.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking from experience, taking an oath\Nof sisterhood isn't a definite thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.12,0:09:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had a bonded sister, Ronko?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.34,0:09:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.02,0:09:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was a fellow maid\Nat the cafe I worked at.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.22,0:09:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was very capable at her duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.60,0:10:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we were sisters, Ronka.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you so against this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that Miss Michio decided\Non a non-aggressive defense policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going out on the offense\Nwould go against her wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.70,0:10:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protecting this cafe\Nserves to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.56,0:10:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For that, we've got to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.28,0:10:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I disagree.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.56,0:10:18.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(979,501.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}RANKO
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.22,0:10:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea where she is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.52,0:10:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you against this sisterhood?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.84,0:10:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky Dwing Cafe is now at\Nodds with the made alien group.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.22,0:10:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't rule out the possibility of\NNerula turning on you at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even knowing that, I still\Nwant to stick by Nerula's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.52,0:10:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.36,0:10:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, um, you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.36,0:10:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, um, I want you to join me in an oath\Nof sisterhood and be friends forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.94,0:10:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Nagomi, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:10:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I belong to different groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.48,0:11:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.39,0:11:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that! Still!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're being serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.90,0:11:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my show of resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.70,0:11:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to become sisters with\Nyou and stay friends forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I'm going\Nto be a big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.82,0:11:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's be sisters, Nagomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.10,0:11:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you might say\Nno and think I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what the higher-ups might\Nsay, I'm going to dream big and go, go.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.21,0:11:34.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(851.2,246.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}DORAMA
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us partake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.18,0:11:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have partaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.12,0:11:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you two are now bonded in sisterhood,\Nmay it be everlasting and joyous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.44,0:12:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now please ready your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.34,0:12:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.54,0:12:11.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(889.6,803.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}NAGOMI
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.88,0:12:13.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540.8,216)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}NERULA
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let your noodles get limp. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.60,0:12:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.82,0:12:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're used to conducting\Nthese things, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.98,0:12:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have the pork, Nagomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you take the egg, Nerula.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.02,0:12:34.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(768,529)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Maidalien
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go crush that pigsty\Nthey call the oinky-doink.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.70,0:12:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rampage and plunder to\Nyour heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.52,0:12:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with the pouty faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.82,0:12:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to say something, spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot of things have changed\Nsince you've been gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.48,0:12:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to do things different?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The creatures in us, we've\Nkept a respectful distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.86,0:12:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Y 'all are mighty cocky when it comes\Nto sitting there bitching and moaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what is it then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.82,0:12:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think the kind of sissy\NETs who stand by and let wuv
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.24,0:13:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wuv moonbeam get crushed can\Nmake the Akiba Big Bang happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.74,0:13:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, what's this Akiba Big Bang anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.84,0:13:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the Akiba Baan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you be a part of\NMade Alien and not know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.10,0:13:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Made Alien maids are extra\NAkiba terrestrial invaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.34,0:13:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All wussy maids get sunk\Nin the sea of tranquility!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.14,0:13:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.98,0:13:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If y 'all can't exterminate\Nthose filthy swine,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.62,0:13:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it'll be your cafes that\Nwill all get a nice, good probing.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.91,0:13:32.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1059.4,180.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}NERULA
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.10,0:13:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.64,0:13:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you've made an oath of\Nsisterhood, she's your sister, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.66,0:13:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means she's basically like\Na daughter to me, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.52,0:13:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's have her over sometime for a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.58,0:13:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that be too dangerous right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.40,0:13:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a casual mother and daughter thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.16,0:13:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to have a nice long chat with\Nher, like about Nerula's little cafe,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and about Maid Alien, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.16,0:13:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chief, exploiting a bond of sisterhood?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.12,0:14:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we really don't have\Na choice now, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.02,0:14:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really get what's\Ngoing on right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wants a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.44,0:14:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd really love to get some info on\Nthe head of Maid Alien and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.76,0:14:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because, hey, us and Maid Alien,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.62,0:14:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're like sardines up against a\Nsperm whale, so getting info is key.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.08,0:14:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're despicable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.54,0:14:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of person does that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.40,0:14:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize we're all gonna\Nget slaughtered at this rate?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm like an overprotective\Nparent to you, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, show your adorn mommy some love.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True that, it may be our\Nonly viable prospect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, given the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.80,0:14:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A spy is our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.46,0:14:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.74,0:14:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a test of your dignity as a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.74,0:14:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every one of you maids must do what\Nyou should as members of Maid Alien.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.94,0:14:53.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(790.6,163.2)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Invader Café Destron
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.00,0:14:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wubwub Moonbeam was viciously\Nravaged by the creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.94,0:14:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to kill the guilty pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.60,0:14:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will prove our superior\Nprowess to the universe and use
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this opportunity to exterminate\Nall creatures from Akiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:14:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The war for our world is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.70,0:15:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.00,0:15:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a starfruit event\Ngoing on this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.32,0:15:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, that's yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.52,0:15:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're having a top shot pork\Nchop dance. That sounds lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to come visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.26,0:15:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our cafe. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? So. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.18,0:15:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.30,0:15:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh. Yeah. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.06,0:15:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping me pick them up.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.29,0:15:39.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(422,281)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Maidalien plans to
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.29,0:15:39.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(422,356)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}storm Oinky Doink.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.29,0:15:39.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(422,432)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}End goal is to annihilate
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.29,0:15:39.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(422,508)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Creatureland Group.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.14,0:15:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean for real, they're\Nactually after us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they're planning to crush us\Nto trigger an all-out war, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is valuable info.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.54,0:15:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not for this note, we\Nwould have been sitting ducks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.22,0:15:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Totally awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.13,0:15:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.05,0:15:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should thank the spy. Nagomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.38,0:16:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, dutiful daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay. Never mind then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.26,0:16:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mistress Manami, the cops are here. Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.03,0:16:16.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(230,551)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Extra-Akiba
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.03,0:16:16.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(230,626)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Terrestrials
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.24,0:16:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard you got a new acting head, so I\Nfigured I should drop by and say hello.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.87,0:16:16.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(979,97)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Maidalien
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, I hear you're going to have\Na romp with Creatureland sometime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.52,0:16:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I know what\Nyou mean by all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.22,0:16:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we got tipped off, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just we police have\Nto investigate these
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.46,0:16:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,things or we meet the\Nwrath of the citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.00,0:16:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it really looks like made aliens\Ndoing rather well, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.94,0:16:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Officer,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.85,0:16:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just came back to\Ntown and can't tell the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.68,0:16:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shower Dory exit from\Nthe Electric Town exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do hope we can rely on you for guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.24,0:17:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good money down the drain\Nwhere'd that leak come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go find that goddamn squealing rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.94,0:17:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right by the way, apparently the police\Nrep made alien headquarters the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.86,0:17:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So wait? Does that mean\Nwe're safe to stroll?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.12,0:17:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cannot let our guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.56,0:17:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be on high alert for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.92,0:17:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So make sure you don't go anywhere alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.36,0:17:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't been able to reach Nerula since\Nshe handed me that note the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.24,0:17:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.56,0:17:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a tough kid, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.54,0:17:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell that about people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.12,0:17:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi, do you wish to go\Nout and search for Nerula?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to do what I can for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.50,0:17:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I shall accompany you on\Nyour strolls starting tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.50,0:17:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.41,0:17:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The oinky-doink is being\Ntargeted right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.28,0:17:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we need to make sure\Nwe are on our guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.46,0:17:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty certain this is the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.02,0:17:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta erase her then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're tracking her down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.86,0:18:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No sign of Nerula on\Nthe street today either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you been able to sleep at all lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm too worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.38,0:18:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's alive. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said the kid's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.76,0:18:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen Nerula recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.14,0:18:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.05,0:18:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where was she?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nerula!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.70,0:18:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you here, Nogomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.50,0:18:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I caused you to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're looking for me\Nbecause I betrayed Maid Alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.68,0:18:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.47,0:18:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.70,0:18:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I got to see you\None last time, Nogomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.68,0:18:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.92,0:18:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stick by\Nmy own Maid principles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.44,0:18:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.04,0:19:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.20,0:19:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conspiring with the swine?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.36,0:19:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just making small talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.02,0:19:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what you've gone and done,\Ngetting in the way of us crushing the pigs?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That traitorous mouth of yours\Nneeds permanent shutting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I would do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Gospodin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.31,0:19:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.23,0:19:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, do it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is between me and the made aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two should leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.04,0:19:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the quiet one I met\Nat the old ramen joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.96,0:19:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.18,0:19:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here I thought we\Nwere gonna be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a shame, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.38,0:19:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it was meant to be, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.48,0:19:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll crush your face along with\Nthe rest of you creature land pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you you sure are brave you know\Nwho you're pointing that blade at?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.06,0:19:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah crimson supernova prepare to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.82,0:19:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh look at you trying to be\Nbad. This better be worth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.40,0:19:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miyabi, stay out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.40,0:20:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better loosen that grip there, brave one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.86,0:20:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nerula! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.36,0:20:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.94,0:20:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're just starting to annoy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bronco, you've got to go help her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.94,0:20:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is their issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.40,0:20:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we don't do\Nanything, Nerula will...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to be an Akiba maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.52,0:20:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nerula knew just what she\Nwas getting herself into.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.88,0:20:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares about all that maid crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.66,0:20:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nerula is my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.54,0:20:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those words are all I ever needed to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.00,0:20:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Traitors only have one place to\Ngo, and that's straight to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.86,0:20:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.77,0:20:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.44,0:21:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.96,0:21:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.18,0:21:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.43,0:21:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way! Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.26,0:21:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harming one of ours goes\Nagainst the code, does it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.98,0:21:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put that thing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.90,0:21:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you do is cry without doing\Nshit, and you call yourself a maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.24,0:21:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Minami, the cops are on their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.02,0:21:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like we're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.12,0:21:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now don't forget, pigs, our\Nwar is just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.72,0:21:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.12,0:21:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blood won't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.00,0:21:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.78,0:21:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I dragged you into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.50,0:21:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.48,0:21:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was me!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.75,0:21:59.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(603.2,278.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}NAGOMI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.40,0:22:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have lived\Na little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.00,0:22:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sister, sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.74,0:22:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you won't ever change
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.62,0:22:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the way you truly are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.56,0:22:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be the maid you are now.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.86,0:22:24.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(923.2,318.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}NAGOMI
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.06,0:22:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.03,0:22:28.49,ED Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\1a&HF1&\blur6\fad(200,200)}When you don't know the meaning of love
Dialogue: 2,0:22:24.03,0:22:28.49,ED Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.8\fad(200,200)}When you don't know the meaning of love
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.03,0:22:28.49,ED Lyrics - Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\1a&HF3&\blur4\fad(200,200)}Ai no imi nado shiranakereba
Dialogue: 2,0:22:24.03,0:22:28.49,ED Lyrics - Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fad(200,200)}Ai no imi nado shiranakereba
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.95,0:22:36.00,ED Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\1a&HF1&\blur6\fad(200,200)}There's nothing to be afraid of
Dialogue: 2,0:22:29.95,0:22:36.00,ED Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.8\fad(200,200)}There's nothing to be afraid of
